<title>USA: Dow falls 50 points in early trading.</title>
<headline>Dow falls 50 points in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue-chip stocks fell on Friday, mirroring a sharp fall in bond prices.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 51.80 points to 8,136.20 at 9:36 a.m. EDT, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
